# ROS 1 compatible /set_velocity for teleop.html and blocks; forwarded to
# flight/set_velocity (technic_interfaces/srv/SetVelocity), valid for the web_api
# parameter velocity_valid_for (0.5 s): repeat the call to keep moving.
# yaw is a heading in frame_id ("body": relative to the current heading), NaN keeps it.
# auto_arm is not supported: take off first.
float32 vx
float32 vy
float32 vz
float32 yaw
string frame_id
bool auto_arm
---
bool success
string message
